===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|narrowly}} ''[[Electrophorus electricus]]'', a species of fish resembling an [[eel]] (though not related) that is capable of generating powerful [[electric shock]]s.
# {{lb|en|broadly}} Any species of the genus ''Electrophorus''.
# A [[plumber's snake]] powered by [[electricity]].

